ro\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    lookup: the row-native expander recognizes the call.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  - compile-program threads a compile-time macro-env naming the defmacros\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    seen so far, only so the native defn lowering yields to a user defn macro.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  Stream operations (stream/make, stream/put, stream/take, >!, <!) are compiled\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  as regular function applications and resolved through the module system at runtime.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  The compiler is written in .cljc format to run on both JVM and Node.js.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  (:refer-clojure :exclude [compile]))\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n;; Forward declaration for mutual recursion\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n(declare compile-form compile-lambda)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n(defn literal?\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Check if a value is a literal (self-evaluating).\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  [form]\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  (or (number? form)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      (string? form)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      (true? form)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      (false? form)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      (nil? form)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      (keyword? form)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      (vector? form)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      (set? form)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      (map? form)))\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"exit_code\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":0,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"completed\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"}}\\\\\\\\ncollab/1793294621496-compiler-engineer-hardening2.gpt-6.1-sol.stdout.log:23:{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"item.started\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"item_11\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"command_execution\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"command\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/bin/zsh -lc \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"python3 -